<title>USA: Parallel Petroleum sells 2.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Parallel Petroleum sells 2.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Texas 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parallel Petroleum Corp said on Friday that it sold 2.5 million shares which was priced at $4.25 per share in a public offering.</p>
<p>The company said it would use the net proceeds of $9.4 million to reduce outstanding bank debt.</p>
<p>Van Kasper &amp; Co served as lead underwriter of the issue.</p>
<p>Parallel Petroleum is engaged in the exploration for, and the acquisition, development, production and sale of oil and gas.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
